  "description": "The classic British fool, a dessert of fruit and whipped cream, is an ideal warm weather dessert because it's light and balance of sweet and tart fruit flavors. Juicy macerated strawberries, strawberry compote, and tangy yogurt are spooned into this refreshing, light version.",
  "notes": "Total time, including resting: 1 hr 20 min.\n\nNotes: Instead of portioning into individual glasses, you can also serve the fool family-style in a large bowl or trifle dish.",
